      "translation": "返回通过从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jms/connection/CachingConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jms.connection\"><code>CachingConnectionFactory</code></a> 解包而获得的原生 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/jms/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.jms\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a>。如果未检测到 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jms/connection/CachingConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jms.connection\"><code>CachingConnectionFactory</code></a> 包装器，则返回给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/jms/ConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.jms\"><code>ConnectionFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
